[HEADING=1][DD] Bump - Automated Semantic Version Bumping for XenForo 2.3[/HEADING]

[B][DD] Bump[/B] is a developer CLI tool designed for XenForo 2.3 add-on developers. It streamlines the release and development workflow by automatically calculating and updating semantic version IDs according to XenForo standards.

[HEADING=2]Key Features & Benefits[/HEADING]
[LIST]
[*][B]Semantic Version Calculator[/B]: Automatically parses XenForo integer version IDs and computes the exact next version ID for major, minor, patch, alpha, beta, rc, and stable releases.
[*][B]Instant File & Database Sync[/B]: Updates both [ICODE]addon.json[/ICODE] and the [ICODE]xf_addon[/ICODE] database table simultaneously in a single CLI command.
[*][B]Interactive Console Guidance[/B]: Guides you through version selection interactively if parameters are omitted.
[*][B]Zero Overhead[/B]: Lightweight CLI execution with zero performance impact on public forum rendering.
[/LIST]

[HEADING=2]Requirements[/HEADING]
[LIST]
[*][B]XenForo[/B]: 2.3.0 or higher
[*][B]PHP[/B]: 8.2.0 or higher
[/LIST]

